<%# Where to unblock notifications: iOS keeps a Home Screen app's in its own Settings, a browser in its site settings.
    The script marks an iPhone or iPad (data-apple) and the words for it show. -%>
<span data-apple-only>Blocked in iOS Settings → Notifications → <%= app_name %>. Allow them there, then come back.</span>
<span data-apple-not>Blocked in this browser's site settings. Allow notifications for this site there, then come back.</span>
